WEBVTT

00:01:29.693 --> 00:01:32.111
We have no potatoes.

00:01:32.135 --> 00:01:34.108
And if you ask me about potatoes,

00:01:34.132 --> 00:01:35.483
I will find you.

00:01:35.507 --> 00:01:36.726
(Laughter)

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:40.198
This part of Idaho is known
for mountain lakes,

00:01:40.222 --> 00:01:42.047
horseback riding,

00:01:42.071 --> 00:01:43.319
skiing.

00:01:43.684 --> 00:01:46.938
Unfortunately, starting in the 1980s,

00:01:46.962 --> 00:01:50.969
it also became known
as the worldwide headquarters

00:01:50.993 --> 00:01:52.984
for the Aryan Nations.

00:01:53.348 --> 00:01:56.911
Every year, members of the local
neo-Nazi compound

00:01:56.935 --> 00:01:59.924
would turn out and march through our town,

00:01:59.948 --> 00:02:01.158
and every year,